  "changelog": "Initial public release with robust NTFS read-write support for macOS:\n\n- Enables automatic, reliable NTFS read-write mounting\u2014plug and use, no more copy failures.\n- One-step installation with full self-check, dry-run mode, and simple uninstall.\n- Handles major domestic network hurdles: GitHub/Formula access, Homebrew bottling issues, Clang build changes, and modern macOS launch agent system.\n- Safe and reversible: automatic backups, easy rollback, no disk data modification.\n- Multi-disk support with fail-safe retries and permission checks; minimizes recurring issues.\n- Detailed guides and troubleshooting included for smooth user experience.",
